285
00:11:53,754 --> 00:11:55,340
You just said..

286
00:11:55,382 --> 00:11:56,633
You know, uh..

287
00:11:56,675 --> 00:11:58,259
Of course, you're
my best friend.

288
00:11:59,427 --> 00:12:01,804
Would you please
tell Rachel, though?

289
00:12:01,846 --> 00:12:03,848
Alright. Alright,
