370
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:43,192
Oh.

371
00:15:43,234 --> 00:15:44,736
That's better then.

372
00:15:45,737 --> 00:15:47,988
This was just
a drunken mistake

373
00:15:48,030 --> 00:15:49,783
